{
  "id": "3788e53dd6024bd89ae3e5b23d6315ce",
  "title": "FailSafe 6.0.12: From Change to Confidence",
  "sample_rate": 48000,
  "tracks": [
    {
      "id": "b9ce7d1a52c3496e9c4d6ecff4f89049",
      "kind": "voice",
      "name": "Narration",
      "clips": [
        {
          "id": "d325f7fffd594e77aa85f9e46ba3433a",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 48000,
          "frame_count": 414796,
          "asset_id": "voice_01df7e9befd69d77bea5a03369660e984bcf88d278a8706e8d3b225dfe418cb3",
          "text": "AI can help you write code faster. But when something changes, how do you know what happened, what it affects, and whether it's ready to ship?",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "456450029e4a42ecb5e2ad5736d2d773",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 537600,
          "frame_count": 520208,
          "asset_id": "voice_bb6c9a6d1cfeda5a3912eed036608759b5987f22a5d54bab350cb734f1562460",
          "text": "Meet FailSafe. A development companion that helps solo developers keep their work visible, understand potential risks, and maintain a record of important decisions.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "6048183551e54e2c939cf2c078647646",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 1113600,
          "frame_count": 412386,
          "asset_id": "voice_42f9d2b1a58296c4c26e81b2518036f73ad13b0bbce3bf82399ddf3f38fca52b",
          "text": "Setup starts in the Console. Install the Qor-Logic skills, approve the request in VS Code, and the workspace is ready.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "22091fd27dca4120a09a9822fe083f59",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 1617600,
          "frame_count": 738484,
          "asset_id": "voice_120826a503127d1468132402da96ca0d311b0cb7743ac7dc1910fc6a9a826334",
          "text": "With version 6.0.12, the Console, Monitor, and SRE views share a consistent visual experience. Change your theme, and your workspace follows. The information stays familiar, wherever you're working.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "e9bd5ce990d34fbfa17755e1217abb02",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 2452800,
          "frame_count": 593920,
          "asset_id": "voice_79bea39d29cdad313b56d7f7528797fe20fbdf96c3762222d50fa5db32564ecf",
          "text": "Now imagine a small but important bug. A date validator accepts a day that doesn't exist. We document the issue, write a regression test, and see the failure for ourselves.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "6820502478934fadbd627bdb09319706",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 3124800,
          "frame_count": 487830,
          "asset_id": "voice_6e9d235814ef27848ca93f6e01aaeff6d9754ccef2469b5a5d84eb8938f4b2ca",
          "text": "Fixing the code is only part of the job. FailSafe helps surface the risks and governance requirements around a change, so the developer knows what still needs attention.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "fc6c7d8357404c478a4fb42c36167c45",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 3672000,
          "frame_count": 490240,
          "asset_id": "voice_755f404861717969c182743c93c757e14936367f1150e928f322b40ece30cecd",
          "text": "The corrected validator passes its tests. We can inspect the difference, see the recorded decisions, and compare the result with what we intended to change.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "f4c6c39bf3dd4ec79448e25c57851df0",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 4209600,
          "frame_count": 567416,
          "asset_id": "voice_2925a320a691fc64d0bb3bf70150f824ae6cb9991ca7982c819c54655edaf647",
          "text": "Every change has a story. What we set out to do, what we changed, what we checked, and what still needs review. FailSafe helps make that story easier to follow.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        },
        {
          "id": "c939c1b223e742fe9cb0fe3df96b7ec7",
          "kind": "voice",
          "start_frame": 4819200,
          "frame_count": 388744,
          "asset_id": "voice_fa73daac412ea82164923bfabbf30d1d0642a2fb23b64f3a83339b8bf443051c",
          "text": "Move faster without losing sight of the work. FailSafe. Build with AI. Know what changed.",
          "voice_id": "",
          "gain_db": 0.0,
          "fade_in_frames": 0,
          "fade_out_frames": 0,
          "loop": false
        }
      ],
      "muted": false,
      "gain_db": 0.0
